": "2574086872868973", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162716_173683813225273_921481625584271360_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h4XZuNIeFOMQ7kNvwFa4hpd&_nc_oc=AdmNXM0P2S2DHm_xewqEUQQN1XVTrDo3Dai9vHTaoLmxkTWYMI9vEOYk_neZJ6A93_s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvkn6B6TxWc894tdiAP2xEcXugFoERjVRv0nGV9k_OAfw&oe=699992F4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "1713008935524509", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162763_821811624658356_6738265622511091712_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Eyf4klnjxdQQ7kNvwGWGyF1&_nc_oc=Adlf1jnKj4LiISYi1RijqoWpcVHic94ypzJvaXSEhx7iDqQSpwIAW8LEGTXAvsz8ioc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftJyliMWthpQ4N6gUHbtLYy7zHM7A45MxQCMf0lSjzzAg&oe=6999C29F"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "913276845770000", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162716_309301642809703_3634431536675160064_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MQY5yLwCToAQ7kNvwGIHUOT&_nc_oc=Adkyb9vy_8WMskTsgLEVLIVND3slbvlx9NG8crPl_ZyXd38ui84XOPBo9-Wp1xdFWXw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuUuHfrhiLSBd-8jO5utKTveto8XqNUSA8JpFSic6PSiA&oe=6999B7DE"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "220267052508465", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_322834038196860_322204868838162432_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zGrzHYewc3AQ7kNvwFqXnCO&_nc_oc=AdmJKL4opbVt7qE8SrBl3Bja81gxlSWVSMgRmbf7pe2FEfeQohAkpD744vIkXIzDuOA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsE0Gmeacvr1WBhrANdlx6UxQEG2KXKnQMmvET_KkZTag&oe=69998DBE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "75262744_592055948252052_3174710684126543872_n.png", "id": "2273427452851341", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75363516_2273427456184674_5101230653467287889_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EffVI-EnGdoQ7kNvwGgtwPc&_nc_oc=Adld7S09M_ghl0gXKy-6-XsJrwQ-WKrLC5BfhEngblSQ_aMY3_by1ZzknZC5Yr8oQRA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuqj_GCtV88M3TuxxYJc1plBxyxNGc7nD8LT8lSMbtZDg&oe=6999B072"}, "display_name": "Fail Factory! Demo", "keywords": ["Puzzle", "Casual", "Arcade", "Physics", "Demo"], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in a whimsical robot factory while climbing your way up the corporate ladder from lowly intern to esteemed star employee. In a wacky spectacle of increasing chaos, strive to keep up with the escalating comedy of errors as you operate various assembly lines in a myriad of mini-games. Entrenched in a physics-based, no consequences playground, experience three main types of mini-game stations, all with the goal to help the factory build robots on a massive scale. \n \nWorking in assembly stations, sorting stations and quality assurance protocol (QAP), where you\u2019ll control unfathomably large robots, you\u2019ll hone your skills in a factory that feels reactive and alive, allowing for a fully immersive experience. Designed with approachability in mind, ridiculous failure is inevitable as you work your way to the top in this vibrant, witty and comedic stress-inducing Fail Factory!.", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in a whimsical robot factory while climbing your way up the corporate ladder from lowly intern to esteemed star employee. In a wacky spectacle of increasing chaos, strive to keep up with the escalating comedy of errors as you operate various assembly lines in a myriad of mini-games. Entrenched in a physics-based, no consequences playground, experience three main types of mini-game stations, all with the goal to help the factory build robots on a massive scale."}]}, "developer_name": "Armature Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.meta.com/legal/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.meta.com/legal/quest/games-terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Oculus", "support_website_url": null, "web